    -> withhold-every-item-conclusion-when-any-answer-not-obtained  [regression/explicit]
       A conclusion that holds only if every item was judged is withheld for a run in
       which some answer was not obtained.

[constraint-06] An identifier drawn from a set that is the same for every call of a run
